# =============================================================================
# apps/vsx — Environment variables
# =============================================================================
# The VS Code extension does NOT read any environment variables. All
# configuration is contributed via VS Code settings (package.json
# `contributes.configuration`) and stored in the user's VS Code settings.json:
#
#   fdh.port                       (default 9456) WebSocket port
#   fdh.autoStart                  (default true)
#   fdh.sourceMapPathOverrides     (default webpack:///./src/ → src/)
#
# This file is intentionally near-empty — kept so contributors know there is
# nothing to set up at the shell before running `bun run dev`.
